  "query_preview": "..\nThe moist monsoonal flow continues to bring heavier showers and\nisolated thunderstorms across the Marianas, especially for Tinian and\nSaipan tonight. As newly formed Invest 91W develops and shifts\nnortheast, the monsoon flow will drift north with it by tomorrow. \nDrier air is then expected to move into the Marianas and lower \nprecipitation chances through Saturday, especially for Guam and Rota.\nBy Sunday, monsoonal moisture may return to bring more scattered \nshowers and isolated thunderstorms through early next week.",
